{"unit_id": "tag:01VM:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n设<MATH_0002>是一个可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0003>-模（module）。\n称<MATH_0004>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>相对甚充足（relatively very ample）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，更确切地说，为<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0005>-相对甚充足（relatively very ample）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0003>甚充足（very ample）于<MATH_0006>上<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0004><MATH_0007>-甚充足（very ample）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>，是指存在拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0008>-模（module）<MATH_0009>和浸入（immersion）<MATH_0010>，其在<MATH_0011>上，且<MATH_0012>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "甚充足"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "甚充足"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "两个概形之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "给定模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "定义所讨论的可逆对象。"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足", "context": "定义所命名的性质。"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足", "context": "在术语前写明所相对的态射。"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "甚充足", "context": "在术语之后用 on 指明底概形。"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "甚充足", "context": "在术语前写明所相对的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "存在条件中模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "定义的存在条件所要求的拟凝聚