{"unit_id": "tag:01VL:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由于这一定义没有拟紧性（quasi-compactness）假设，相对甚充足（relatively very ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）一般并非相对充足（relatively ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对充足"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性", "context": "定义中没有作出的假设。"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足", "context": "前一种可逆层的相对正性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰相对甚充足的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "论及的相对甚充足的对象。"}, {"source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对充足", "context": "在这里一般无法推出的相对正性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰相对充足的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "陈述中的相对充足对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01VN:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n设<MATH_0002>是一个可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0003>-模（module）。\n若<MATH_0004>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，且<MATH_0005>是相对甚充足（relatively very ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），则<MATH_0006>是相对充足（relatively ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对充足"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理给定的概形之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "给定模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "引理给定的可逆对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "引理对给定态射的假设。"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚充足", "context": "引理假定的可逆层的相对正性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰假设中的相对甚充足层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "假设中具有相对甚充足性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对充足", "context": "引理推出的可逆层的相对正性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰结论中的相对充足层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "结论中具有相对充足性质的对象。"}], "notes": []}
